property_value: http://purl.org/dc/terms/contributor "PSO:cooperl" xsd:string

[Term]
id: PSO:0000711
name: wheat leaf rust fungal disease
def: "A wheat disease caused by a Puccinia triticina affecting a vascular leaf." [AUTO:patterns/disease]
comment: Symptoms and signs: brown rust uredinial pustules turn into black telial pustules in late plant growth stages.
synonym: "brown rust" EXACT []
xref: APSNET:Wheat
