property_value: http://purl.org/dc/terms/contributor "PSO:cooperl" xsd:string

[Term]
id: PSO:0000712
name: wheat stripe rust fungal disease
def: "A wheat disease caused by a Puccinia striiformis affecting a vascular leaf." [AUTO:patterns/disease]
comment: Symptoms and signs: yellow to orange rust pustules tending to form stripes in late plant growth stages and turn into black telial pustules.
synonym: "yellow rust" EXACT []
xref: APSNET:Wheat
