[Term]
id: PSO:0000713
name: wheat stem rust fungal disease
def: "A wheat disease caused by a Puccinia graminis f. sp. tritici affecting a vascular leaf or a stem." [AUTO:patterns/disease]
comment: Symptoms and signs: red uredinial pustules turn into black telial pustules few days after uredinial pustules development.
synonym: "black rust" EXACT []
xref: APSNET:Wheat
