id: PSO:0000734
name: wheat tan spot fungal disease
def: "A wheat disease caused by a Pyrenophora tritici-repentis affecting a vascular leaf." [AUTO:patterns/disease]
comment: Symptoms and signs: oval to diamond -shaped lesions with tan necrotic spots, brown centers, and yellow holos.
synonym: "Red smudge" EXACT []
synonym: "Yellow leaf spot" EXACT []
xref: APSNET:Wheat
