property_value: http://purl.org/dc/terms/contributor "PSO:cooperl" xsd:string

[Term]
id: PSO:0000739
name: wheat Sclerotinia snow mold fungal disease
def: "A wheat disease caused by a Sclerotinia borealis affecting a whole plant." [AUTO:patterns/disease]
comment: Symptoms and signs: In the spring, dead leaves and plants are gray and thready. Numerous black, irregularly shaped sclerotia are usually present in and on diseased tissues.
synonym: "Snow scald" EXACT []
xref: APSNET:Wheat
