[Term]
id: PSO:0000743
name: wheat spot blotch fungal disease
def: "A wheat disease caused by a Bipolaris sorokiniana affecting a plant structure." [AUTO:patterns/disease]
comment: Small dark-brown lesions that elongate into blotches; dead leaves; shrivelled grain with black point; staining of embryo end of grain.
xref: APSNET:Wheat
